    challengesHtml: `<h3>Carrying a Scene</h3><p>Fivio has had to represent Brooklyn drill while navigating the expectations created by the movement's rapid rise and major losses.</p><h3>Beyond Catchphrases</h3><p>His long-term challenge is turning instantly recognizable ad-libs and singles into a full catalog with depth and range.</p>`,
    culturalImpactHtml: `<p>Fivio Foreign helped bring Brooklyn drill's bounce, slang, and ad-lib language into mainstream rap.</p><p>His career reflects how New York street rap renewed itself through local identity and global drill production.</p>`,
