    challengesHtml: `<h3>Independent Scale</h3><p>Millyz has had to build reach without the instant machinery of a major viral breakout.</p><h3>Trend Resistance</h3><p>Keeping dense street lyricism central can be difficult in a market that often rewards shorter, lighter records.</p>`,
    culturalImpactHtml: `<p>Millyz represents modern independent East Coast rap rooted in bars, testimony, and regional pride.</p><p>His career shows how persistence and catalog continuity can build a durable fanbase.</p>`,
    legacyHtml: `<p>Millyz's legacy is still growing, but his lane is defined.</p><p>He stands as a Cambridge-rooted independent rapper whose writing keeps street reflection and lyricism at the center.</p>`,
